Time Complexity

      Suppose
      
              Search Space = 1...1,000,000
              
                      Binary Search performs              
              log₂(1,000,000)              
              ≈20              
              iterations.
              
              If each validation takes              
              O(n)
              
              Overall complexity becomes              
              O(n log M)
              
              where
                    n = input size
                    M = size of the answer search space

